From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 06:51:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] usb: dwc3: rtk: defer the probe while the dwc3 core is not
 bound

The dwc3 core defers while its extcon device is not ready. The glue then
failed with -ENODEV and never retried, so the port stayed dead. Defer
instead.

Signed-off-by: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
---
 drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-rtk.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-rtk.c b/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-rtk.c
index 56c53e0..3e448c2 100644
--- a/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-rtk.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-rtk.c
@@ -305,8 +305,8 @@ static int dwc3_rtk_probe_dwc3_core(struct dwc3_rtk *rtk)
 	dwc3_dev = &dwc3_pdev->dev;
 	rtk->dwc = platform_get_drvdata(dwc3_pdev);
 	if (!rtk->dwc) {
-		dev_err(dev, "failed to find dwc3 core\n");
-		ret = -ENODEV;
+		/* the core defers, e.g. while its extcon is not ready */
+		ret = dev_err_probe(dev, -EPROBE_DEFER, "dwc3 core is not bound yet\n");
 		goto err_pdev_put;
 	}
 
-- 
2.53.0

